%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%BC%9A%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E9%A2%9D%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E5%80%8D%E7%8E%87%EF%BC%9BQTE%E4%B8%8E%E5%BF%85%E6%9D%80%E6%8A%80%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%AD%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E9%A2%9D%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8%E6%8A%80%E4%BC%A4%E5%AE%B3%EF%BC%8C%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E6%98%BE%E8%91%97%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E3%80%90%E9%A5%B4%E9%9F%B3%E3%80%91%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E7%9A%84%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%E7%8E%87%EF%BC%9B%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E5%B8%A6%E6%9C%89%E3%80%90%E9%A5%B4%E9%9F%B3%E3%80%91%E5%8D%B0%E8%AE%B0%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E6%97%B6%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E9%A2%9D%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%9B%9E%E5%A4%8D%EF%BC%9B%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%86%BB%E7%BB%93%E7%A7%AF%E8%93%84%E5%9C%A8%E5%BA%94%E5%AF%B9%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%9B%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%9C%BA%E5%90%88%E6%8B%A5%E6%9C%89%E8%BE%83%E5%A5%BD%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%A8%E7%8E%B0%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22img%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fact-upload.mihoyo.com%2Fbh3-wiki%2F2023%2F05%2F31%2F282941837%2F6bf6cc8c903d0e885b9a3a317b6834af_339110553557509589.gif%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1685550823025\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/05/31/282941837/5e828fa6681ebb74c1f8194b0125bbb4_5539651713507327324.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>糖露星霜</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">推荐武器，提高了角色的输出和辅助能力，可以提供额外的能量回复和冻结积蓄，很好的契合了角色的机制。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/05/31/282941837/6bf6cc8c903d0e885b9a3a317b6834af_339110553557509589.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">兼顾输出和辅助的冰伤双枪武器。提供一定的常驻全队冰伤与自身增伤，武器技后施加【饴音】印记可进一步提高全队全伤。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">糖露星霜装备时，会提供额外的倍率；QTE与必杀技命中后可以造成额外的武器技伤害，能够显著提高【饴音】效果的覆盖率；攻击带有【饴音】印记的目标时可以提供额外的能量回复；武器提供的冻结积蓄在应对一些特殊场合拥有较好的表现。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/05/31/282941837/6bf6cc8c903d0e885b9a3a317b6834af_339110553557509589.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
